What jimc wants to do with binxo can be said in lojban using the
following tanru, which, I've inverted to make the place structure match]
his goal:

la djan. [cu] binxo co jalge lenu [ri] speni la meris.
John is a becomer of-type resulting in the-event [he is-married-to Mary].
John becomes married to Mary.

or as John C. expressed it

la djan. [cu] binxo lo speni be la meris.
John becomes the spouse of Mary.

or 

la djan. binxo ja'e lenu [ri] speni la meris.
John becomes ... with result the-event [he] is-married-to Mary.

-lojbab

